    "title": "关于组织收看专家访谈讲座的通知",
    "source": "流动党员支部",
    "publishDate": "2023-03-06",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; 为深入学习贯彻党的二十大精神，人民教育社开展《如何引导青少年爱读书、读好书、善读书》专家访谈讲座，讲座时间：</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">6</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日（今天）晚</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">18</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">点</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">20</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">分，请全体党员准时收看直播。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">流动党员支部</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2023</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span></span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt\">6</span><span style=\"font-siz